  "historical_output_text": " Hi Jane,\n\nThought you and Pete would appreciate hearing this! Just got off of a jog in my favorite route that takes a little walk in the park to cool off after. And there's the most amazing sound, which you can actually catch if walking in one of your nearby paths! A pair o' wood pigeots making the cuttest, little, flutter sound. You could just imagine the sound as them flutter'n wings. And I just wanted for everyone else in my hood could have a similar experience like that too, so sharing this tid' of info!\n\nHope it was useful and a reminder that we have all these wonderful natural experiences around the neighborhood that are often so subtle that they pass right under your eyes without even realizing! 😅 \n\nLet us catch some of this natural music and make the moment!\n\nAll my Best!\nLinda 💧",
